t. 
|  In this chapter we examine some of the aftershocks of the family
|  court earthquake - the sociological and psychological consequences to
|  mothers who rebel against the system. We look at what has happened to
|  mothers who fled with their children and to those who stayed behind to
.  resist

--- Sentence/end 
