t. 
|  Hunted Syndrome can lead to fatal mistakes. In 1996, a mother from
|  Maryland died because she ignored a lump she had found in her breast
|  while on the run. As a fugitive (with her daughter), she feared getting
|  medical help because of the possibility that her medical records could
|  lead the FBI to her. Her tumor was malignant, and it eventually killed
.  her

--- Sentence/end 
